      ],
      "summary": "A partial-history tracker accepted an out-of-turn move even after a full FEN had verified the side to move.",
      "root_cause": "The first-transition alternate-side branch used incomplete history and an empty move list as its only gate. It ignored turn_verified, which observe can set independently on a same-placement full FEN.",
      "reproduction": "Observe placement after 1.e4 e5 2.Nf3 without known turn, verify the full FEN (Black to move), then submit the placement after an illegal immediate white Bb5. Baseline accepts f1b5 for both turn_known=True and False.",
      "fix": "Only create the alternate-side candidate while turn_verified is false; retain legal-transition reconstruction and conservative partial-history behavior.",
      "behavior_after": "Wrong-side update rejected without mutating board/history; actual Black Nc6 accepted; either first mover still inferable while turn is unknown."
    }
  ],
